<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-RESULT IN THE SPANISH CUP QUARTER FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULT IN THE SPANISH CUP QUARTER FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>VIGO, Spain 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the Spanish Cup,</p>
<p>quarter-final, second leg on Thursday:</p>
<p> Celta Vigo  1  Racing Santander     0</p>
<p>(Celta win 3-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>playing later:</p>
<p>Rayo Vallecano v Real Betis (Betis won first leg 2-0)</p>
<p>played Wednesday:</p>
<p> Barcelona	5  Atletico Madrid	4</p>
<p>(Barcelona win 7-6 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Espanyol  1  Las Palmas   1</p>
<p>(1-1 on aggregate, Las Palmas win on away goals rule)</p>
</text>
